              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Why install a kiosk in your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">It's no surprise that all the biggest fast-food outlets on the planet are equipped with ordering terminals. Saving time on a daily basis, increasing sales, advanced personalization, quick and easy checkout, and even menu management based on stock levels are just some of the advantages of kiosks.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937ab-3a2f12da" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937ab" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does an order terminal work?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Equipped with a touch screen, printer and payment terminal, the order terminal allows your customers to enter their order and pay without the help of an employee. Via an order path specially designed for your restaurant, customers browse the menu, select their meal and pay by credit card, while the order is sent directly to the kitchen.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937b6-3a2f12da" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937b6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can a control unit be installed outdoors?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Depending on the configuration of your restaurant, it may be possible to install an Innovorder bollard outdoors. Another solution is to install the bollard on an articulated arm that can be deployed outdoors via a window.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937c1-3a2f12da" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937c1" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do you choose an order terminal for your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Many criteria come into play when choosing a kiosk: the layout of your establishment, the size of your store, your sales targets, your customer journey, your budget, the design and ergonomics you're looking for, and the level of personalization you need. The best thing is to talk it over with an expert who can help you make the right choice!<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-eca944c7-e927-db18-f140-25ee0b443993-3a2f12da" data-w-id="eca944c7-e927-db18-f140-25ee0b443993" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How can you make it easier to use the order terminal in your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                <li>Assign a member of staff to manage the restaurant and assist customers. He or she will be able to accompany your customers and facilitate order-taking.</li>
                <li>Keep the human touch by explaining to your customers that the order terminal allows them to choose and order their menu quickly and freely.</li>
                <li>Make your kiosks accessible to improve order-taking in your restaurant. The location of order terminals plays a crucial role. Whatever their size, touch-sensitive kiosks should be strategically positioned near the entrance or in a visible, easily accessible place for quick use.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-f6b7f5ed-b7a9-f2d7-47f5-087295c35895-3a2f12da" data-w-id="f6b7f5ed-b7a9-f2d7-47f5-087295c35895" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How many ordering terminals should you install in your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The number of order terminals to be installed depends mainly on the volume of tickets processed daily. At Innovorder, we generally recommend:<br>‍<br></div>
              <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                <li>Up to 80 tickets per day: 1 terminal</li>
                <li>Between 80 and 160 tickets per day: 2 terminals</li>
                <li>More than 160 tickets per day: 3 or more terminals</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions _2">This estimate helps to streamline service and reduce waiting times for your customers.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_7170691d-6a62-fc7b-0acf-3d4bb72e2764-3a2f12da" data-w-id="7170691d-6a62-fc7b-0acf-3d4bb72e2764" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I rent a kiosk for my restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, leasing kiosks is an advantageous option for restaurateurs. It preserves cash flow by avoiding a major initial investment, and offers the flexibility to adapt the equipment as your needs evolve.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_7c8cc4cd-bc4f-e59e-4d75-0ff3db2e081b-3a2f12da" data-w-id="7c8cc4cd-bc4f-e59e-4d75-0ff3db2e081b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do I create a product on the order terminal?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Products are managed via the Innovorder back-office. As soon as you are installed, we train you in its use so that you are 100% autonomous. You can then easily add, modify or delete items, adjust prices and organize your menu according to your preferences. This interface allows you to keep your offer up to date on your own, without the need for special technical assistance.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_1ca1858f-e83c-943b-b9de-338329bfd70a-3a2f12da" data-w-id="1ca1858f-e83c-943b-b9de-338329bfd70a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the advantages of a control terminal?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Order kiosks improve the customer experience by reducing waiting times and streamlining the purchasing process. They increase the average basket thanks to intelligent suggestions, and optimize staff organization by limiting manual order-taking.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-cdf2d48e-e642-56b7-a851-1cfb278c2090-3a2f12da" data-w-id="cdf2d48e-e642-56b7-a851-1cfb278c2090" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the main criteria for choosing a control terminal?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The main criterion is to match your space and customer flow. Depending on the size and layout of your restaurant, you can opt for a free-standing, wall-mounted, countertop or articulated arm kiosk.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_25f00759-1038-de3c-ae94-cc030ef2f29c-3a2f12da" data-w-id="25f00759-1038-de3c-ae94-cc030ef2f29c" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How to choose the right restaurant ordering terminal?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">It's important to take several criteria into account: available space, order volume, desired customer experience and integration with your cash register software. Our experts can help you find the ideal solution.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_90420e75-3027-b630-0e8e-f18c1e766546-3a2f12da" data-w-id="90420e75-3027-b630-0e8e-f18c1e766546" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Which cash register software should you choose for your kiosk?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">It's essential to choose cash register software that's compatible with your order terminal, to ensure smooth synchronization of orders and payments. Innovorder offers a complete, integrated solution that adapts to your business.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_0080142e-2fcb-758b-1488-4cff47403547-3a2f12da" data-w-id="0080142e-2fcb-758b-1488-4cff47403547" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Is the terminal multilingual?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, our terminals are multilingual. Your order path and menus are available in five languages: French, English, Spanish, Italian and German.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_34c6a2fd-9742-d467-10e7-ccbcf7aca07b-3a2f12da" data-w-id="34c6a2fd-9742-d467-10e7-ccbcf7aca07b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I join a loyalty program?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, our kiosks are compatible with the best loyalty programs on the market, including Como, Hey Pongo and Splio, enabling customers to collect points and benefit from personalized offers.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_532d4105-e039-f35e-3188-661d019ce060-3a2f12da" data-w-id="532d4105-e039-f35e-3188-661d019ce060" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What sizes are the control terminals available in?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our bollards are available in a range of sizes to suit any space:<br>- 15 inches: compact and unobtrusive<br>- 22 inches: standard size for optimum visibility<br>- 27 inches: ideal for establishments with high order volumes<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div><div class="section cta-kiosk">
      <div data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937cd" style="opacity:0" class="middle-section-wrapper">
        <div class="_40px-txt white">Ready to get started?</div>
        <div class="cta-sub-kiosk">Visit our showroom now for a demonstration and see what your restaurant could look like.</div>
        <a href="/en/contact-us" class="button-icon-hp3 w-inline-block">
          <div>Equip my restaurant</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div><FooterEn /></div>
  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script is:inline>

    var lastIdx = -1;

    $('.volume-marquee__collection-item').on('mouseover', function(){

    	if(lastIdx == $(this).index())
        return;
    
      lastIdx = $(this).index();

    	let image = $(this).find('.volume-marquee__image')[0].src;
      let volumeName = $(this).find('.volume-marquee__volume-name')[0].innerText;
      let volumeNumber = $(this).find('.volume-marquee__volume-number')[0].innerText;
      let backgroundColor = $(this).find('.volume-marquee__volume-color').first().css('backgroundColor');
  
      $('.volume-preview__image').first().fadeOut(100, function() {
      	$(this).attr('src', image).fadeIn(100);
      });
    
      $('.volume-preview__volume-name').first().fadeOut(100, function() {
      	$(this).text(volumeName).fadeIn(100);
      });
    
      $('.volume-preview__volume-number').first().fadeOut(100, function() {
      	$(this).text(volumeNumber).fadeIn(100);
      });
  
      $('.volume-preview__background').first().css('backgroundColor', backgroundColor);
  
    });

    </script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/swiper/swiper-bundle.min.js" is:inline></script>
    <script src="https://weblocks.io/library.js" is:inline></script>
    <script src="https://weblocks.io/script-66-529.js" is:inline></script>
  </Fragment>
